    "- `UNITID` — institution identifier used for merging  \n",
    "- `STABBR` — state abbreviation  \n",
    "- `REGION` — U.S. Census region code  \n",
    "\n",
    "These variables are used to control for geographic differences in earnings outcomes across institutions.\n",
