   "source": [
    "### Data Merging and Final Analytic Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "IPEDS finance data were merged with College Scorecard earnings data using `UNITID`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Geographic identifiers were then merged using `UNITID`.\n",
    "\n",
    "ACS state median household income data were merged using `STABBR`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Institutions missing key variables were removed to ensure consistent regression models. One institution with zero funding per student was removed before log transformation because log values cannot be computed for zero.\n",
    "\n",
    "Log-transformed variables were created for funding per student and earnings because both variables were strongly right-skewed in the EDA Checkpoint.\n",
    "\n",
    "The final analytic dataset contains 631 institutions."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "metadata": {},
